window.CET6_DATA("data/articles/day-043.json",{"day":43,"title":"The Rooftop Garden Experiment","targetWords":[{"word":"propose","gloss":"提议","context":"When tenants began to propose a rooftop garden, the building manager pictured weeds to pull and birds to feed rather than a serious improvement.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"pull","gloss":"拔","context":"When tenants began to propose a rooftop garden, the building manager pictured weeds to pull and birds to feed rather than a serious improvement.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"feed","gloss":"提供食物","context":"When tenants began to propose a rooftop garden, the building manager pictured weeds to pull and birds to feed rather than a serious improvement.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"flow","gloss":"流动","context":"Rainwater would flow through the drainage system, and residents might wake to noise from early volunteers.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"wake","gloss":"醒来","context":"Rainwater would flow through the drainage system, and residents might wake to noise from early volunteers.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"exhibit","gloss":"展览","context":"Yet a small exhibit of possible designs made him smile.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"smile","gloss":"微笑","context":"Yet a small exhibit of possible designs made him smile.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"escape","gloss":"逃离","context":"The garden offered a place to escape crowded streets without leaving home.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"vote","gloss":"投票","context":"Before a vote, engineers would assess whether the roof could support it and recommend any necessary reinforcements.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"recommend","gloss":"建议","context":"Before a vote, engineers would assess whether the roof could support it and recommend any necessary reinforcements.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"climb","gloss":"攀爬","context":"Nobody could simply climb upstairs, tie a few pots to the railing, and assume the project was safe.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"tie","gloss":"系","context":"Nobody could simply climb upstairs, tie a few pots to the railing, and assume the project was safe.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"abandon","gloss":"放弃","context":"The group refused to abandon the idea when the first estimate proved expensive.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"throw","gloss":"投入","context":"They also would not throw money into an untested design.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"behave","gloss":"表现","context":"Residents agreed on how visitors should behave and how volunteers would monitor water use.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"monitor","gloss":"监测","context":"Residents agreed on how visitors should behave and how volunteers would monitor water use.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"reject","gloss":"拒绝","context":"They would reject heavy structures and warn children not to jump between planting boxes or crash into fragile equipment.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"jump","gloss":"跳跃","context":"They would reject heavy structures and warn children not to jump between planting boxes or crash into fragile equipment.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"crash","gloss":"碰撞","context":"They would reject heavy structures and warn children not to jump between planting boxes or crash into fragile equipment.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"concentrate","gloss":"集中注意","context":"The team needed to concentrate on achievable benefits.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"urge","gloss":"敦促","context":"A gardener would urge them to choose plants whose smell was pleasant but not overpowering.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"smell","gloss":"气味","context":"A gardener would urge them to choose plants whose smell was pleasant but not overpowering.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"transform","gloss":"改变","context":"Careful design could transform an empty roof into shared space, although even the best gardening tip could not remove the need for regular maintenance.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"tip","gloss":"建议","context":"Careful design could transform an empty roof into shared space, although even the best gardening tip could not remove the need for regular maintenance.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"pose","gloss":"带来","context":"Wind would pose a challenge, and residents could not attribute every unhealthy plant to poor soil.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"attribute","gloss":"归因于","context":"Wind would pose a challenge, and residents could not attribute every unhealthy plant to poor soil.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"absorb","gloss":"吸收","context":"Some materials absorb water well but add unwanted weight.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"locate","gloss":"找到位置","context":"Engineers helped locate sheltered areas and reverse a plan that placed beds beside emergency exits.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"reverse","gloss":"扭转","context":"Engineers helped locate sheltered areas and reverse a plan that placed beds beside emergency exits.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"skim","gloss":"略读","context":"A busy tenant might skim a notice, so diagrams had to convey rules clearly.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"convey","gloss":"传达","context":"A busy tenant might skim a notice, so diagrams had to convey rules clearly.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"stick","gloss":"坚持","context":"Organizers would stick to a manageable schedule and recruit a few reliable volunteers before trying to cultivate the entire roof.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"recruit","gloss":"招募","context":"Organizers would stick to a manageable schedule and recruit a few reliable volunteers before trying to cultivate the entire roof.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"cultivate","gloss":"种植","context":"Organizers would stick to a manageable schedule and recruit a few reliable volunteers before trying to cultivate the entire roof.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"beat","gloss":"击败","context":"Their aim was not to beat a neighboring building in a competition.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"laugh","gloss":"笑","context":"People could laugh at a failed crop, provided that the experience would prompt an adjustment rather than careless repetition.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"prompt","gloss":"促使","context":"People could laugh at a failed crop, provided that the experience would prompt an adjustment rather than careless repetition.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"shrink","gloss":"收缩","context":"As summer approached, dry soil began to shrink away from the sides of containers under strong heat.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"invent","gloss":"发明","context":"Nobody needed to invent a complicated machine to solve everything; volunteers could witness the effect of simple shade.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"witness","gloss":"见证","context":"Nobody needed to invent a complicated machine to solve everything; volunteers could witness the effect of simple shade.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"rush","gloss":"匆忙","context":"They learned not to rush a decision or surround seedlings with larger plants that blocked sunlight.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"surround","gloss":"围绕","context":"They learned not to rush a decision or surround seedlings with larger plants that blocked sunlight.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"anticipate","gloss":"预料","context":"They would anticipate holidays and submit a watering schedule before leaving.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"submit","gloss":"提交","context":"They would anticipate holidays and submit a watering schedule before leaving.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"tap","gloss":"水龙头","context":"A leaking tap required immediate attention, since standing water might breed insects and upset neighbors below.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"breed","gloss":"滋生","context":"A leaking tap required immediate attention, since standing water might breed insects and upset neighbors below.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"upset","gloss":"惹恼","context":"A leaking tap required immediate attention, since standing water might breed insects and upset neighbors below.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"remind","gloss":"提醒","context":"Signs would remind visitors that a shared garden depended on considerate behavior.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"sacrifice","gloss":"牺牲","context":"Each household might sacrifice a little free time to tackle a problem that benefited everyone who used the space.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"tackle","gloss":"解决","context":"Each household might sacrifice a little free time to tackle a problem that benefited everyone who used the space.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null}],"paragraphs":[{"en":"When tenants began to propose a rooftop garden, the building manager pictured weeds to pull and birds to feed rather than a serious improvement. Rainwater would flow through the drainage system, and residents might wake to noise from early volunteers. Yet a small exhibit of possible designs made him smile. The garden offered a place to escape crowded streets without leaving home. Before a vote, engineers would assess whether the roof could support it and recommend any necessary reinforcements. Nobody could simply climb upstairs, tie a few pots to the railing, and assume the project was safe. Its success depended on preparation as much as enthusiasm.","zh":"住户开始提议屋顶花园时，楼宇管理者想到的是要拔的杂草和要喂的鸟，而非真正的改善。雨水会流经排水系统，居民可能被早起志愿者的声音吵醒。不过，一场展示可能设计方案的小展览让他露出了微笑。花园提供了一个不必离家就能逃离拥挤街道的地方。投票之前，工程师将评估屋顶是否能够承重，并建议必要的加固措施。人们不能随便爬上去，把几只花盆系在栏杆上，就认为项目安全。成功既取决于准备，也取决于热情。"},{"en":"The group refused to abandon the idea when the first estimate proved expensive. They also would not throw money into an untested design. Residents agreed on how visitors should behave and how volunteers would monitor water use. They would reject heavy structures and warn children not to jump between planting boxes or crash into fragile equipment. The team needed to concentrate on achievable benefits. A gardener would urge them to choose plants whose smell was pleasant but not overpowering. Careful design could transform an empty roof into shared space, although even the best gardening tip could not remove the need for regular maintenance.","zh":"第一份估算显示费用高昂时，团队没有放弃，也不愿把钱投入未经检验的设计。他们约定来访者的行为规则，以及志愿者如何监测用水。他们会拒绝重型结构，并告诫孩子不要在种植箱之间跳跃，或撞上易损设备。团队需要集中于可实现的收益。一位园丁建议选择气味宜人但不过分浓烈的植物。精心设计能够把空屋顶变成共享空间，但再好的园艺建议也不能免除定期维护。"},{"en":"Wind would pose a challenge, and residents could not attribute every unhealthy plant to poor soil. Some materials absorb water well but add unwanted weight. Engineers helped locate sheltered areas and reverse a plan that placed beds beside emergency exits. A busy tenant might skim a notice, so diagrams had to convey rules clearly. Organizers would stick to a manageable schedule and recruit a few reliable volunteers before trying to cultivate the entire roof. Their aim was not to beat a neighboring building in a competition. People could laugh at a failed crop, provided that the experience would prompt an adjustment rather than careless repetition.","zh":"风是一个挑战，居民不能把每株生长不良的植物都归因于土壤。有些材料吸水性好，却增加了不必要的重量。工程师帮助找到避风区域，并改变把种植床放在紧急出口旁的计划。忙碌住户可能只略读通知，因此图示必须清楚传达规则。组织者会坚持可行的日程，先招募几位可靠志愿者，再考虑种满屋顶。目标不是在竞争中击败邻楼。大家可以为一次歉收发笑，但经验必须促使调整，而不是漫不经心地重复错误。"},{"en":"As summer approached, dry soil began to shrink away from the sides of containers under strong heat. Nobody needed to invent a complicated machine to solve everything; volunteers could witness the effect of simple shade. They learned not to rush a decision or surround seedlings with larger plants that blocked sunlight. They would anticipate holidays and submit a watering schedule before leaving. A leaking tap required immediate attention, since standing water might breed insects and upset neighbors below. Signs would remind visitors that a shared garden depended on considerate behavior. Each household might sacrifice a little free time to tackle a problem that benefited everyone who used the space.","zh":"夏天临近，高温下干燥的土壤开始收缩，与容器边缘分离。没有必要发明一台复杂机器来解决所有问题，志愿者可以亲眼看到简单遮阴的作用。他们学会不匆忙决策，也不把会遮挡阳光的大植物围在幼苗周围。他们会提前考虑假期，并在离开前提交浇水安排。漏水龙头需要立即处理，因为积水可能滋生昆虫，惹恼楼下邻居。标识提醒来访者，共享花园有赖于体谅他人的行为。每户或许都要牺牲少量空闲时间，解决让所有使用者受益的问题。"},{"en":"The first harvest was too small to replace anyone's shopping. Nevertheless, residents began to value changes that did not appear in the original budget: brief conversations, shared skills, and a calmer place to sit. The manager observed that disputes became easier to settle when people already knew one another. He did not turn the garden into a cure for urban isolation. It remained an experiment with costs and responsibilities. Its lesson was more precise: an ordinary building could support meaningful cooperation when a modest idea was tested patiently and its practical limits were taken seriously from the beginning.","zh":"第一次收获很少，无法代替任何人的日常采购。然而居民开始珍视原预算没有体现的变化：简短交谈、技能共享，以及更安静的休息场所。管理者发现，人们已经认识彼此时，争端更容易解决。他没有把花园说成城市孤独的万能疗法。它仍是一个有成本、有责任的实验。它的启示更具体：只要耐心检验一个适度想法，并从开始就认真对待实际限制，普通建筑也能够支持有意义的合作。"}],"previous":42,"next":44});
